Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? So it's\Nrecovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I how can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I recover my body\Nand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,my mind every single\Nday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to make sure that my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,body, if I'm\Ntreating it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,like a Ferrari and I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,want it to go that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,fast every single\Nday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to recover. I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,have to treat my\Nbody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,with with love,\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I'm not\Neating,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm not\Nstretching, if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.07,0:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not drinking\Nwater, if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sleeping, if\NI'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,not staying off my\Nfeet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm not all of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,these small things,\Nthen I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,don't have a chance\Nto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,be my best.
